			<div class="content" id="post-content-742685">
									

<p>Heads still rot, and a guillotine that makes pissed off talking heads is totally something that MC&amp;D would market or the Foundation would contain with or without a useful angle. I think you are over-estimating the horror of regular executions within the Foundation when they're doing that on a monthly basis <em>already</em>. Making any kind of item that tries to balance its utility by requiring human sacrifice just doesn't cut it, especially given the larger context.</p>
